      "originalText": "  Hypothesis 1a               🔨 │  › Data  › Training  › Evaluation\n  Holds: it adds to the rating   │\n                                 │  Results  What do all the models say?\n  Claim 1a                       │   for Hypothesis 1a · b03 j02 t01  ▸ 4 runs\n  Beyond the rating: …           │  Discovery  Has anyone shown this?\n  Contribution 1a                │   b01 j01 t01 prior_work  supports\n  A new signal: …                │",
